  "world": {
    "title": "world",
    "desc": "The target destination world for this region.\n\n- Supports exact world names (e.g. `world`, `world_nether`, `custom_world`).\n- Supports world index placeholders:\n  - `[0]`: Primary host world (default Overworld)\n  - `[1]`: Nether world\n  - `[2]`: The End world",
    "html": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0; font-size:0.82rem; line-height:1.4;\">The target destination world for this region.<\/p>\n<ul style=\"margin:6px 0 6px 18px; padding:0; font-size:0.82rem; line-height:1.4;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Supports exact world names (e.g. <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>world<\/b><\/code>, <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>world_nether<\/b><\/code>, <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>custom_world<\/b><\/code>).<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Supports world index placeholders:<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\"><code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>[0]<\/b><\/code>: Primary host world (default Overworld)<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\"><code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>[1]<\/b><\/code>: Nether world<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\"><code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>[2]<\/b><\/code>: The End world<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
    "meta": "Type: String / Placeholder | Default: '[0]' | Docs: REGIONS.md / WORLDS.md",
