    "html": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0; font-size:0.82rem; line-height:1.4;\">If true, the <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>shape<\/b><\/code> block is replaced by a square matching the world's vanilla <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>/worldborder<\/b><\/code>, and the configured <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>radius<\/b><\/code> / <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>centerRadius<\/b><\/code> / <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>centerX<\/b><\/code> / <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>centerZ<\/b><\/code> are ignored. See <a href=\\\"#region-size-radius-and-centerradius\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);\\\">Region Size<\/a>.<\/p>",
