  "cachecap": {
    "title": "cacheCap",
    "desc": "Target capacity of verified safe locations maintained in the background pool.\n\n- As players execute `/rtp`, locations are popped from this queue.\n- Background asynchronous workers automatically calculate new candidate coordinates to keep this queue topped up.\n- Higher values absorb teleport rushes during peak server events.",
    "html": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0; font-size:0.82rem; line-height:1.4;\">Target capacity of verified safe locations maintained in the background pool.<\/p>\n<ul style=\"margin:6px 0 6px 18px; padding:0; font-size:0.82rem; line-height:1.4;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">As players execute <code style=\\\"color:var(--yellow);\\\"><b>/rtp<\/b><\/code>, locations are popped from this queue.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Background asynchronous workers automatically calculate new candidate coordinates to keep this queue topped up.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Higher values absorb teleport rushes during peak server events.<\/li>\n<\/ul>",
